abstract: >
  Secondment technical report (October 26 – November 6, 2025, Airfield Estate,
  Dublin, Ireland) documenting the migration of the Entrust Data Sharing MCP
  Platform from a static prompt-based architecture to a MindsDB agent-based
  system. Reports 60–75% faster queries, 20%→100% data utilisation, and
  multi-file correlation validated against real agricultural data.
  EU Horizon ENTRUST Doctoral Network, Grant Agreement No 101073381.
